Package: xkbflag-rs
Version: {{version}}
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: 12000
Architecture: {{arch}}
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libx11-6, libxcb1, libxext6, libxtst6, libdbus-1-3
Maintainer: Aleksandr Muga <aleksandr.muga@south.rt.ru>
Description: Floating keyboard layout flag near the cursor
 Shows current keyboard layout (RU/EN) as a flag next to the cursor.
 Click to switch language, drag to move, scroll to resize. Tray icon with
 "Follow cursor" and "Quit" actions. Requires X11.
